244	     * Handles {@link DuplicateHouseholdException} thrown when an owner is created with the same
245	     * last name and address as an existing owner (compared case-insensitively with collapsed
246	     * whitespace) without opting in via {@code sharesHousehold}. Returns a 409 Conflict whose
